ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda, did you get hold of the SWOT Peter wrote?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes, I've reviewed it and I'd like to suggest making some changes that would better our chances of becoming their PR representative.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That would be great. I understand that Farmani would like us to send a proposal discussing how we would market and sell their new clothing line. Our main competition are the Garcia partners."}, {"time": "22000", "image": "engenn6le09ob09re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: The way I see it, we have more marketing experience but Garcia has the cultural advantage with their staff. I'm figuring our staff could do with some briefing in Latin American culture.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I agree. If we use the resources we have more effectively, we will rise to the challenge.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Exactly. I know that we will succeed if we take the right approach. Why don't we recognize some of the roles our team members hold? I'm thinking particularly of Ferdinand, Renando and Renata."}, {"time": "54000", "image": "engenn6le09ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That's a good idea. I am confident we are going to overcome our challenges if we watch our expenses. Ferdinand may need some advice there.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Point taken. A properly funded business will succeed if it keeps track of its expenses. You know, the market in South America is increasingly investing in clothing which is bringing in many new clients. Ferdinand's people skills are outstanding, but he should be partnered with someone more careful financially."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}